  "description": "The Holocaust was the systematic, state-sponsored persecution and murder of six million Jews by Nazi Germany and its collaborators during World War II. It is one of the most horrific events in human history and is universally recognized as a symbol of genocide and human atrocity. Referencing it in a meme context trivializes its gravity and is deeply offensive.",
